delta-backup (0.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Right click on the empty space of the home folder offers "Restore Previous Version…", so what was deleted from it can be recovered.
  * The cache of Flatpak apps (~/.var/app/*/cache) is no longer backed up.
  * Every failure of Borg is in the daemon's log, with its exit status and all it said, and a question of a window that breaks is still answered.

